<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/NXS24-5.1.5> a ipbes:SubChapter ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/NXS24ch5.1> ;
    ipbes:Reference <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/4596166/items/4QZW9KHJ>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/4596166/items/53ZKFHK4>,
